# Redirect legacy Netlify subdomain to the primary production domain.
# Must come first — rules are evaluated top to bottom, first match wins.
# The 301! (forced) ensures every path on the old domain redirects,
# including static files, consolidating SEO signals onto hasbal.com.ng.
https://hasbal-global-solutions.netlify.app/*  https://hasbal.com.ng/:splat  301!

# Serve logo as favicon.ico — fixes Google Search Console 404
